---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import catalog from '../data/catalog.json';
import { CATEGORIES } from '../lib/catalog.ts';
const featured = catalog.slice(0, 8);
const cats = CATEGORIES.filter((c) => catalog.some((e) => e.category === c.slug));
---
<BaseLayout title="PARADOX — Discover, inspect and verify AI agents" description="Discover public AI agents, paste a GitHub URL, and inspect health, freshness, stack, and static risk indicators before you run anything.">
  <main>
    <section class="hero-home">
      <div class="hero-home-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">AI AGENT INTELLIGENCE / 01</p>
        <h1>Discover AI agents you can actually <em>understand.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Search public agents and GitHub projects, then inspect what they do, how fresh they are, what they require, and which static risk indicators show up in the repository.</p>
        <form class="search-row" method="get" action="/agents/">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="homeQuery">Search AI agents</label>
          <input id="homeQuery" name="q" type="search" placeholder="Search agents, skills, repositories, MCP…" />
          <button type="submit"><span>Search</span></button>
        </form>
        <div class="sub-actions">
          <a href="/verify/">Verify a GitHub agent →</a>
          <a href="/compare/">Compare two repositories →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="cats" aria-label="Agent categories">
          {cats.map((c) => <a href={`/categories/${c.slug}/`}>{c.label}</a>)}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pv-hero-visual" aria-label="PARADOX intelligence network visualization">
        <div class="pv-orbit"></div>
        <div class="pv-core"><strong>PX</strong></div>
        <div class="pv-node n1"><b>REPOSITORY</b><span>indexed</span></div>
        <div class="pv-node n2"><b>RISK ENGINE</b><span>scanning</span></div>
        <div class="pv-node n3"><b>FRESHNESS</b><span>live signal</span></div>
        <div class="pv-node n4"><b>STACK</b><span>detected</span></div>
        <div class="pv-wave"></div>
        <div class="pv-scan"><span>NETWORK STATUS <strong>ONLINE</strong></span><span>48 SIGNALS / MIN</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="pv-stats" aria-label="Platform signals">
      <div class="pv-stat"><span>Indexed intelligence</span><strong>PUBLIC REPOS</strong><em>LIVE</em></div>
      <div class="pv-stat"><span>Evidence model</span><strong>STATIC SIGNALS</strong><em>ON</em></div>
      <div class="pv-stat"><span>Inspection mode</span><strong>NO EXECUTION</strong><em>SAFE</em></div>
      <div class="pv-stat"><span>Decision layer</span><strong>COMPARE / VERIFY</strong><em>READY</em></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="pv-section-head">
        <div><span class="pv-section-label">02 / CURATED SIGNALS</span><h2>Featured agents.</h2></div>
        <p>Start with public systems already catalogued by PARADOX, then inspect the evidence behind each profile.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        {featured.map((e) => (
          <article class="agent-card">
            <div class="meta"><span>{e.owner}</span><span>{e.category}</span></div>
            <h3>{e.repo}</h3>
            <p>{e.summary}</p>
            <div class="links">
              <a href={`/agents/${e.owner}/${e.repo}/`}>Open profile</a>
              <a href={`/verify/?url=${encodeURIComponent(`https://github.com/${e.owner}/${e.repo}`)}`}>Verify</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
      <div class="pv-section-head">
        <div><span class="pv-section-label">03 / RECENT ACTIVITY</span><h2>Recently catalogued.</h2></div>
        <p>New repositories enter the catalog as discoverable starting points. Live health signals are checked when you inspect them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        {catalog.slice(8).map((e) => (
          <article class="agent-card">
            <div class="meta"><span>{e.owner}/{e.repo}</span></div>
            <h3>{e.repo}</h3>
            <p>{e.summary}</p>
            <div class="links"><a href={`/agents/${e.owner}/${e.repo}/`}>Open profile</a></div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.visually-hidden{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);border:0}
</style>
